{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜打擊及防範詐騙(二)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-13-14-05-00JkQotojj.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：打擊及防範詐騙</p><p>近日接連有航空公司及商戶資料外洩，市民隨後懷疑被騙徒假冒客服詐騙，警方有甚麼打撃措施？市民應如何防範？</p><p>嘉賓：商業罪案調查科反詐騙協調中心警司李蔚詩</p><p></p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:57:31.304375+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T21:01:10.456533+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:51:01.537558+00:00","content_hash":"3cfabc82ec5664eddb6c88be99de63c950b55232e7693ed0312fe0cd3b08a4b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:57:31.304375+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}